---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Start a conversation with AIspanda about an AI opportunity, delivery challenge or reusable asset.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>What are you trying to make possible?</h1>
    <p class="lede">Share the outcome, the people affected and the biggest uncertainty. A useful first conversation should clarify the next decision—not sell unnecessary complexity.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 1rem">
    <div class="shell contact-panel">
      <div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A helpful message includes</p><h2>Outcome. Context. Constraint.</h2><p>What should change? Who needs it? What currently makes it difficult? Sensitive or confidential information should not be sent by ordinary email.</p></div>
      <div class="contact-details"><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2 style="font-size: 2.3rem">Email AIspanda</h2><p><a href="mailto:rajeevkasatai@gmail.com">rajeevkasatai@gmail.com</a></p><p>Include “AIspanda” in the subject so the context is immediately clear.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
